{"id":"ctabox","code":"<style>.ctbx{width:290px;border:1px solid var(--line,#262C34);border-radius:16px;padding:20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif}\n.ctbx h3{color:var(--ink,#fff);font:800 20px Inter,sans-serif;margin:0}.ctbx p{color:var(--body,#B6BDC8);font:500 11px Inter,sans-serif;margin:0;line-height:1.5}\n.ctbx a{align-self:flex-start;background:var(--accent,#3366FF);color:#fff;font:700 12px Inter,sans-serif;padding:10px 20px;border-radius:999px;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:4px 4px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.5);transition:.15s}.ctbx a:active{transform:translate(2px,2px);box-shadow:none}</style>\n<div class=\"ctbx\"><h3>Get started with GOOD WORK.</h3><p>Build a fast, animated marketing site that converts visitors into customers.</p><a>Get started</a></div>"}